    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc98CHECK THIS OUT!\ud83d\udc98</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description</h2><br>As the strongest female knight in the kingdom, you are trusted by the villagers to explore the dreaded Dungeon.Dive into the depths of the Dungeon and defeat the evil demons.This is a 3D, third-person action game where the player must go into the battlefield alone, gathering supplies and building up strength as you go.But if the enemy catches you, there is hell to pay...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651460/extras/7bfce887eaec2890ad330681297c0207.avif?t=1754452601\" width=614 height=172 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >H Scene</h2><br>With a wealth of animated H-scenes, If you've been knocked down by a demon, pulled away after being hypnotised, or borrowed too much money from a merchant and can't pay it back, you'll be forced into one erotic event after another! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651460/extras/5666cb1b9ec663c79f9a8e492f23f021.avif?t=1754452601\" width=614 height=310 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dressing system</h2><br>There are a variety of special outfits for players to choose from!You can get them by opening treasure chests in dungeons or buying them from merchants, and there's even an H costume that you're forced to wear after being captured by a demon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651460/extras/196e6189e5341b25a0c16e8fd3909a22.avif?t=1754452601\" width=614 height=334 /></span>",
